<title>RUSSIA: Number of Russian banks shrinks to 2,031 - c.bank.</title>
<headline>Number of Russian banks shrinks to 2,031 - c.bank.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of operating banks in Russia shrank to 2,031 on December 1 from 2,263 on February 1, the central bank said in its bulletin on Friday.</p>
<p>The banks' total authorised capital rose to 17.79 trillion roubles from 11.43 trillion roubles, the bank said.</p>
<p>--Irina Demchenko, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
<p>($=5,545 roubles)</p>
</text>
